# coherence_mass_placement_2026-08-04 — .meta
#
# WHAT: per-bake contribution-mass fractions by attribution-decomposability
#       class (E / A / N), joined to the measured M3a coherence, for every
#       bake on the gauntlet board carrying a non-null `m3a_coherence`.
#       Registered method: benchmarks/sota944_campaign_2026-08-03.md,
#       "REGISTERED APPENDIX — COHERENCE MECHANISM" (appendix D), committed
#       at 270f6ecf BEFORE any number in this TSV was computed.
#
# GIT (analysis):   270f6ecf  (registration commit; results commit adds this file)
