#
# COLUMNS
#   m3a, m3            read from the bake's *.fulleval.json (NOT recomputed here)
#   exact_frac         REGISTERED PRIMARY: sum mean|delta| over class-E inputs / total
#   approx_frac        class A / total
#   nondecomp_frac     class N / total
#   decomp_frac        REGISTERED SECONDARY: (E + A) / total
#   fine_frac,s0_frac,s3_frac,mean_scale,eff_n,n_live   POST-HOC diagnostics (NOT registered)
#   n_inputs,n_layers,depth,coarse_decay                registered confound annotations
