# HEADLINE: PRIMARY SROCC(exact_frac, m3a) = +0.0245 -> registered verdict FALSIFIED
#           (threshold <0.40). SECONDARY SROCC(decomp_frac, m3a) = +0.4558, but that
#           is a between-group step (pool-reading bakes vs pool-blind bakes), NOT a
#           gradient: within the pool-blind subgroup (n=44) SROCC(exact) = -0.2408,
